     2	- Tools: run_command (5k char out cap, 300s cmd timeout), read_file (<=150 lines/10k chars), edit_file(old_string,new_string,allow_multiple), write_file, submit_patch (free, ends loop), get_status (free), get_code_neighbors, search_similar_code, get_code_subgraph, skill tools.
