docs/HARNESS_NOTES.md:2:- Tools: run_command (5k char out cap, 300s cmd timeout), read_file (<=150 lines/10k chars), edit_file(old_string,new_string,allow_multiple), write_file, submit_patch (free, ends loop), get_status (free), get_code_neighbors, search_similar_code, get_code_subgraph, skill tools.
docs/HARNESS_NOTES.md:3:- Budgets via eval_config.yaml `evaluation:` {timeout_seconds,max_tool_calls,max_time_minutes,max_turns}. Defaults 60 min / 100 calls(inference.py) / 500 turns. Setup time is NOT counted in the agent budget, but the 12h total includes it.
docs/HARNESS_NOTES.md:5:- Nudges: max 3 consecutive; non-empty source diff is graded even without submit_patch (git add -N . + git diff vs _swegemma_baseline; test/config files stripped).
docs/HARNESS_NOTES.md:6:- Phase 2: fresh container, agent patch (4-pass apply), reset tests, apply test_patch, pytest exit 0; 300s timeout.
