- The search instruction recommends error-message keywords ([system.md:11](/home/ubuntu/work/gemma/bundles/31b/v009/prompts/system.md:11)); the harness recommends symbol names, with keywords receiving only lexical fallback ([HARNESS_README.md:506](/home/ubuntu/work/gemma/data/raw/HARNESS_README.md:506)).
